{
  "format": "p152.styles",
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "studio": {
    "notes": "Seamless cyclorama (v2). 'light' is the default backdrop for every style, 'dark' is the variant (UI toggle). Styles keep their own lighting character; this block gives background, floor and bias values.",
    "light": {
      "background": "#e8e8ea",
      "floor": "#e2e2e5",
      "exposureBias": 0.0,
      "envIntensityBias": 0.0
    },
    "dark": {
      "background": "#1c1e22",
      "floor": "#212328",
      "exposureBias": 0.0,
      "envIntensityBias": -0.15
    },
    "lights": {
      "key": {
        "type": "directional",
        "color": "#fff6ea",
        "intensity": 2.4,
        "position": [1.8, 3.2, 2.2],
        "shadow": "soft (VSM, radius 10)"
      },
      "fill": {
        "type": "directional",
        "color": "#e3ecff",
        "intensity": 0.55,
        "position": [-2.6, 1.8, 1.8]
      },
      "rim": {
        "type": "directional",
        "color": "#ffffff",
        "intensity": 1.1,
        "position": [-0.8, 2.4, -2.6]
      }
    },
    "toneMapping": "Neutral",
    "contactShadow": {
      "opacity": 0.42,
      "technique": "soft radial-gradient plane under each object"
    }
  },
  "notes": "Style presets (ADR-3D-05). Cascade: object override > style.rules.byType[type][role] > style.rules.byRole[role] > object-type slot default. Applying a style never changes positions or params. 'ambience' feeds the lighting preset (R3); the MVP does not expose styles to users.",
